#: slideshow_lock/__init__.py
#: data/io.github.trensoft.slideshowlock.desktop.in
#: data/io.github.trensoft.slideshowlock.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Slideshow Lock"
msgstr "Slideshow Lock"

#: slideshow_lock/control.py
msgid "Start the slideshow service and open the settings window."
msgstr ""
"Tosaigh seirbhís an taispeántais sleamhnán agus oscail fuinneog na socruithe."

#: slideshow_lock/control.py
msgid "at login: start the service, open the window only the first time"
msgstr ""
"ag logáil isteach: tosaigh an tseirbhís, oscail an fhuinneog ar an gcéad "
"uair amháin"

#: slideshow_lock/control.py slideshow_lock/preferences.py
#: slideshow_lock/preview_app.py slideshow_lock/service.py
msgid "log every step"
msgstr "logáil gach céim"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Random"
msgstr "Randamach"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "By file name"
msgstr "De réir ainm comhaid"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Fill the screen (crops the picture)"
msgstr "Líon an scáileán (gearrtar an pictiúr)"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Fit (shows the whole picture)"
msgstr "Oiriúnaigh (taispeántar an pictiúr iomlán)"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "None (change at once)"
msgstr "Faic (athrú láithreach)"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Cross-fade"
msgstr "Trasdhílú"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Fade through black"
msgstr "Dílú trí dhubh"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Slide in"
msgstr "Sleamhnú isteach"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Push"
msgstr "Brú"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Ken Burns"
msgstr "Ken Burns"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Zoom"
msgstr "Zúmáil"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Wipe"
msgstr "Glanadh"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Circle reveal"
msgstr "Nochtadh ciorclach"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Blur"
msgstr "Doiléiriú"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Rotate"
msgstr "Rothlú"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Random mix"
msgstr "Meascán randamach"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Slideshow Lock settings"
msgstr "Socruithe Slideshow Lock"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Picture folder"
msgstr "Fillteán pictiúr"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Browse..."
msgstr "Brabhsáil…"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Picture order"
msgstr "Ord na bpictiúr"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Scaling"
msgstr "Scálú"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Scroll tall pictures"
msgstr "Scrollaigh pictiúir arda"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid ""
"Portrait pictures on a landscape screen move slowly from top to bottom (only "
"with Fill). Off by default: it uses more battery."
msgstr ""
"Bogann pictiúir phortráid ar scáileán tírdhreacha go mall ó bharr go bun "
"(leis an rogha “Líon” amháin). As de réir réamhshocraithe: úsáideann sé níos "
"mó cumhachta ceallraí."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Pictures"
msgstr "Pictiúir"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Between pictures"
msgstr "Idir pictiúir"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid ""
"How a picture changes into the next. \"Random mix\" picks one of eight at "
"each change (not Blur and Ken Burns). Without desktop animations the "
"pictures change at once."
msgstr ""
"Conas a athraíonn pictiúr go dtí an chéad cheann eile. Roghnaíonn “Meascán "
"randamach” ceann amháin as ocht gach uair a athraíonn sé (gan Doiléiriú ná "
"Ken Burns). Gan beochan an deisce, athraíonn na pictiúir láithreach."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Transition length"
msgstr "Fad an aistrithe"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid ""
"How long one change takes, the same for every transition. It is never longer "
"than half of the time a picture is shown."
msgstr ""
"An fhad a thógann athrú amháin, mar an gcéanna do gach aistriú. Ní bhíonn sé "
"riamh níos faide ná leath den am a thaispeántar pictiúr."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "seconds"
msgstr "soicind"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Hardware acceleration"
msgstr "Luasghéarú crua-earraí"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Transitions"
msgstr "Aistrithe"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Idle time"
msgstr "Am díomhaoin"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "How long without input before the slideshow starts."
msgstr "Cá fhad gan ionchur sula dtosaíonn an taispeántas sleamhnán."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Start the slideshow"
msgstr "Tosaigh an taispeántas sleamhnán"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Show each picture for"
msgstr "Taispeáin gach pictiúr ar feadh"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Lock grace period"
msgstr "Tréimhse ghrásta glasála"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid ""
"Input sooner than this after the slideshow starts does not lock the session "
"(strictly sooner; 0 means every input locks)."
msgstr ""
"Ní ghlasálann ionchur níos luaithe ná seo tar éis tús an taispeántais "
"sleamhnán an seisiún (níos luaithe go docht; ciallaíonn 0 go nglasálann gach "
"ionchur)."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Timing"
msgstr "Uainiú"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Preview"
msgstr "Réamhamharc"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Sábháil"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "10 s"
msgstr "10 s"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "1 min"
msgstr "1 nóim"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "1 h"
msgstr "1 u"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "24 h"
msgstr "24 u"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid ""
"Slow movement and soft edges in the transitions. Turn it off for the plain "
"animation."
msgstr ""
"Gluaiseacht mhall agus imill bhoga sna haistrithe. Cas as é chun an bheochan "
"shimplí a úsáid."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid ""
"Not available: this computer does not draw with a graphics card, so the "
"plain animation is used."
msgstr ""
"Níl ar fáil: ní tharraingíonn an ríomhaire seo le cárta grafaice, mar sin "
"úsáidtear an bheochan shimplí."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Choose the picture folder"
msgstr "Roghnaigh an fillteán pictiúr"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Select"
msgstr "Roghnaigh"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Cealaigh"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "The preview could not be started, see the log."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir an réamhamharc a thosú, féach an logchomhad."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "There is no monitor to show the preview on."
msgstr "Níl aon mhonatóir ann chun an réamhamharc a thaispeáint air."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Preview running: press any key or move the mouse to end it."
msgstr ""
"Réamhamharc ar siúl: brúigh aon eochair nó bog an luch chun deireadh a chur "
"leis."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Change the slideshow settings."
msgstr "Athraigh socruithe an taispeántais sleamhnán."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid ""
"The settings schema is not installed. Compile it and point GSettings at it:\n"
"  glib-compile-schemas data/\n"
"  GSETTINGS_SCHEMA_DIR=data python3 -m slideshow_lock.preferences"
msgstr ""
"Níl scéimre na socruithe suiteáilte. Tiomsaigh é agus pointeáil GSettings "
"air:\n"
"  glib-compile-schemas data/\n"
"  GSETTINGS_SCHEMA_DIR=data python3 -m slideshow_lock.preferences"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "Saved."
msgstr "Sábháilte."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "the longest"
msgstr "an ceann is faide"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
#, python-format
msgid "%d s"
msgstr "%d s"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
#, python-format
msgid "%d min"
msgstr "%d nóim"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
#, python-format
msgid "%d h"
msgstr "%d u"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
#, python-format
msgid "In use: %s"
msgstr "In úsáid: %s"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
#, python-format
msgid "In use: %s (the folder does not exist yet, nothing will be shown)"
msgstr "In úsáid: %s (níl an fillteán ann go fóill, ní thaispeánfar tada)"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid ""
"Not a step of the slider: it shows the nearest one. The saved value stays "
"until you move the slider."
msgstr ""
"Ní céim den sleamhnóir é seo: taispeántar an ceann is gaire. Fanann an luach "
"sábháilte go dtí go mbogfaidh tú an sleamhnóir."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "Enter a whole number of seconds."
msgstr "Cuir isteach slánuimhir soicind."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
#, python-format
msgid "The value must be between %(low)d and %(high)d."
msgstr "Caithfidh an luach a bheith idir %(low)d agus %(high)d."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "Enter a whole number for the slider position."
msgstr "Cuir isteach slánuimhir do shuíomh an tsleamhnóra."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "This position is not on the slider."
msgstr "Níl an suíomh seo ar an sleamhnóir."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "This choice is not available."
msgstr "Níl an rogha seo ar fáil."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "This must be on or off."
msgstr "Caithfidh sé seo a bheith air nó as."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "Enter a folder path."
msgstr "Cuir isteach cosán fillteáin."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "The path contains a character that is not allowed."
msgstr "Tá carachtar sa chosán nach gceadaítear."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "Enter an absolute path (it starts with / or ~)."
msgstr "Cuir isteach cosán absalóideach (tosaíonn sé le / nó ~)."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "This path is a file, not a folder."
msgstr "Comhad is ea an cosán seo, ní fillteán."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "The value was not accepted, the old one is kept."
msgstr "Níor glacadh leis an luach, coinnítear an seanluach."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "The value could not be saved."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir an luach a shábháil."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "The folder was not accepted, the old one is kept."
msgstr "Níor glacadh leis an bhfillteán, coinnítear an seanfhillteán."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "The folder could not be saved."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir an fillteán a shábháil."

#: slideshow_lock/preview.py
msgid "No pictures to show"
msgstr "Níl aon phictiúr le taispeáint"

#: slideshow_lock/preview_app.py
msgid ""
"Show the slideshow preview. Any input ends it. It never locks the session."
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin réamhamharc an taispeántais sleamhnán. Cuireann aon ionchur "
"deireadh leis. Ní ghlasálann sé an seisiún choíche."

#: slideshow_lock/preview_app.py slideshow_lock/service.py
msgid "picture folder (this run only)"
msgstr "fillteán pictiúr (don rith seo amháin)"

#: slideshow_lock/preview_app.py slideshow_lock/service.py
msgid "seconds per picture (this run only)"
msgstr "soicind in aghaidh an phictiúir (don rith seo amháin)"

#: slideshow_lock/preview_app.py slideshow_lock/service.py
msgid "picture order"
msgstr "ord na bpictiúr"

#: slideshow_lock/preview_app.py slideshow_lock/service.py
msgid "fit or fill the monitor"
msgstr "oiriúnaigh nó líon an monatóir"

#: slideshow_lock/preview_app.py slideshow_lock/service.py
msgid "scroll portrait pictures slowly (fill mode)"
msgstr "scrollaigh pictiúir phortráid go mall (mód líonta)"

#: slideshow_lock/preview_app.py
msgid "how a picture changes into the next, or none (this run only)"
msgstr ""
"conas a athraíonn pictiúr go dtí an chéad cheann eile, nó faic (don rith seo "
"amháin)"

#: slideshow_lock/preview_app.py
#, python-format
msgid "The interval must be between %d and %d seconds."
msgstr "Caithfidh an t-eatramh a bheith idir %d agus %d soicind."

#: slideshow_lock/preview_app.py
msgid ""
"The settings schema is not installed. Compile it and point GSettings at it:\n"
"  glib-compile-schemas data/\n"
"  GSETTINGS_SCHEMA_DIR=data python3 -m slideshow_lock.preview_app"
msgstr ""
"Níl scéimre na socruithe suiteáilte. Tiomsaigh é agus pointeáil GSettings "
"air:\n"
"  glib-compile-schemas data/\n"
"  GSETTINGS_SCHEMA_DIR=data python3 -m slideshow_lock.preview_app"

#: slideshow_lock/preview_window.py
msgid "Slideshow Lock preview"
msgstr "Réamhamharc Slideshow Lock"

#: slideshow_lock/service.py
msgid ""
"Start the slideshow when the session is idle, lock it on the first input "
"after the grace period, and lock before the machine suspends."
msgstr ""
"Tosaigh an taispeántas sleamhnán nuair a bhíonn an seisiún díomhaoin, "
"glasáil é ar an gcéad ionchur tar éis na tréimhse grásta, agus glasáil é "
"sula gcuirtear an meaisín ar fionraí."

#: slideshow_lock/service.py
msgid "idle seconds before the slideshow"
msgstr "soicind díomhaoin roimh an taispeántas sleamhnán"

#: slideshow_lock/service.py
msgid "no lock for input within this many seconds"
msgstr "gan glasáil le haghaidh ionchur laistigh den líon soicind seo"

#: slideshow_lock/service.py
msgid "The idle timeout must be between 1 and 86400 seconds."
msgstr "Caithfidh an t-am díomhaoin a bheith idir 1 agus 86400 soicind."

#: slideshow_lock/service.py
msgid "The grace period must be between 0 and 86400 seconds."
msgstr "Caithfidh an tréimhse ghrásta a bheith idir 0 agus 86400 soicind."

#: slideshow_lock/service.py
msgid ""
"The settings schema is not installed. Compile it and point GSettings at it:\n"
"  glib-compile-schemas data/\n"
"  GSETTINGS_SCHEMA_DIR=data python3 -m slideshow_lock.service"
msgstr ""
"Níl scéimre na socruithe suiteáilte. Tiomsaigh é agus pointeáil GSettings "
"air:\n"
"  glib-compile-schemas data/\n"
"  GSETTINGS_SCHEMA_DIR=data python3 -m slideshow_lock.service"

#: data/io.github.trensoft.slideshowlock.desktop.in
msgid "Set up the idle slideshow and the session lock"
msgstr "Socraigh an taispeántas sleamhnán díomhaoin agus glasáil an tseisiúin"

#: data/io.github.trensoft.slideshowlock.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Idle slideshow screensaver that locks on input"
msgstr ""
"Spárálaí scáileáin le taispeántas sleamhnán nuair a bhíonn an seisiún "
"díomhaoin, a ghlasálann ar ionchur"

#: data/io.github.trensoft.slideshowlock.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Slideshow Lock starts a fullscreen picture slideshow on every screen when "
"the session has been idle for a set time."
msgstr ""
"Tosaíonn Slideshow Lock taispeántas pictiúr lánscáileáin ar gach scáileán "
"nuair a bhíonn an seisiún díomhaoin ar feadh tréimhse socraithe."

#: data/io.github.trensoft.slideshowlock.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"The first key press, click or mouse movement ends the slideshow. If the "
"slideshow has been showing for at least the grace period, the session is "
"locked as well."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann an chéad bhrú eochrach, cliceáil nó gluaiseacht luiche deireadh "
"leis an taispeántas sleamhnán. Má bhí an taispeántas sleamhnán ar taispeáint "
"ar feadh na tréimhse grásta ar a laghad, glasáiltear an seisiún freisin."

#: data/io.github.trensoft.slideshowlock.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"The pictures come from a folder you choose. A settings window sets the "
"folder, the idle time, the grace period, how long each picture shows, the "
"order and the scaling."
msgstr ""
"Tagann na pictiúir ó fhillteán a roghnaíonn tú. Socraíonn fuinneog socruithe "
"an fillteán, an t-am díomhaoin, an tréimhse ghrásta, cá fhad a thaispeántar "
"gach pictiúr, an t-ord agus an scálú."
